        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-09-10T17:17:41.349Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"31100\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>(Also, random though: Negative Man and The Wraith should do a team-up — “Bandage Buddies!”)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Don’t forget <a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Bandage_People\">the Bandage People</a> (George and Marion) from the Vertigo version of Doom Patrol.  You can do a team book crossover.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Cripes, I need to re-read that series.  I’d almost forgotten they were the ones who recruited <a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Kate_Godwin_(New_Earth)\">Coagula</a> to the Patrol after witnessing her wrecking <a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Codpiece_(New_Earth)\">Codpiece</a> in his first outing.  That’ll teach the JLA to turn her down.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
